From 9a91a846a20dea1c0ae94b1e32825f7381c493b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:58:09 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 062/230] Replace Adsgram Task card with A-ADS banner

Remove the Adsgram SDK and TaskAdCard component entirely, and replace
them with an Anonymous Ads (A-ADS) iframe banner behind the new
ADS_ENABLED switch (renamed from ADGRAM_ENABLED in vite.config,
.env.example, and vite-env.d.ts). AdBanner injects the A-ADS snippet
via innerHTML into a ref, collapses when empty, and uses z-index: 1 so
it never covers the bottom nav. Placed below the Upcoming feed on
Matches and at the foot of MatchDetail.

Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
